    <title>DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet - Releases - 2025-06-30</title>
    <id>https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet#2025-06-30</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet" />
    <updated>2025-07-01T00:08:27Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.20.0"&gt;3.20.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix AWS S3 DeleteBucket integration (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3153736110" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7118" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7118/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7118"&gt;#7118&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix protobuf instrumentation error on versions &amp;lt; 3.13 (before Aug 14 2020) (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3150022394" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7108" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7108/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7108"&gt;#7108&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Capturing GraphQL Errors With SpanEvents (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3021119864" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6899" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6899/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6899"&gt;#6899&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid using AsyncManualResetEvent in DSM stats processing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3098337870" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7027" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7027/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7027"&gt;#7027&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add fix for race condition in &lt;code&gt;InitResult&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3160115044" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7121" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7121/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7121"&gt;#7121&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid using AsyncManualResetEvent in DSM stats processing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3098337870" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7027" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7027/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7027"&gt;#7027&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix AWS S3 DeleteBucket integration (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3153736110" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7118" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7118/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7118"&gt;#7118&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update service discovery check (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3160884492" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7122" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7122/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7122"&gt;#7122&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
